OL,4,CElla Langley sweeps Country Music      
OL,5,CAwards as Taylor Swift performs        
OL,6,GUS singer Ella Langley has swept the   
OL,7,GCountry Music Association Awards       
OL,8,G(CMAs), following the huge success of  
OL,9,Gher breakthrough hit Choosin' Texas.   
OL,11,FThe Alabama-born singer was named      
OL,12,Fentertainer of the year at Wednesday's 
OL,13,Fceremony, weeks after the song became  
OL,14,Fthe longest-running number one in      
OL,15,FBillboard chart history.               
